            "review_title": "Review at City Pizza - Little Italy",
            "review_text": "Misa Strizova\n4 contributions\n1\nGood food, cheap beer and friendly staff\nFeb 2020 • Friends\nWe ate in this restaurant almost every night. We had a great experience, staff is really friendly and went out of their way to deliver great service - quite rare in Vietnam. Food was great! We tried loads of foods - favourites veggie noodles and pork with lemongrass and chilli. They have cheap beer - Saigon, half litre bottle for 15000 dong. Recommended!\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten February 12, 2020",
