            "review_title": "Review at City Pizza - Little Italy",
            "review_text": "Amber\n1 contribution\n0\nNot impressed\nJan 2020 • Couples\nCame here for dinner with my partner after seeing good reviews online. We ordered two pizzas and a drink to share. As I picked up my glass the bottom broke off of it and my drink spilt all over me, I understand that this can happen sometimes however staff then proceeded to charge us for the spilt drink despite it not being our fault. 10 minutes after my partners pizza had arrived, my pizza still had not come and we noticed other tables (who had ordered much later than us) being served their food, we asked staff about our order and they had forgotten about my pizza so we left disappointed. The one pizza that had arrived was pretty mediocre as it didn't have a lot of flavour. I wasn't impressed with the service or the food and will not be going back\nRead more\nWritten January 22, 2020",
