            "review_text": "Zac S\n1 contribution\n0\nVery Unimpressed\nJan 2020 • Couples\nCame here for dinner with my partner. I am not fussy with service, however I was very unimpressed with this restaurant. Firstly their glass broke when my partner picked it up and spilled coke everywhere (which was nobody's fault, just unfortunate), I then asked for a replacement drink which they later charged for. The waiter then forgot one of our orders and then tried to tell me that we had only ordered one and made no effort to rectify an honest mistake. I am not fussed by the mistake, rather the lack of effort and rudeness which followed. The one pizza which came was rather bland and tasteless. I would suggest to avoid this place as there are plenty other places you can get nicer meals (pizzas) for a better price with nicer staff.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten January 22, 2020",
